            "review_title": "Review at Tu Lun Beef Noodle",
            "review_text": "Vyctorya V\nAuckland Central, New Zealand24 contributions\n0\nHide a way best beef noodle in Hanoi\nSep 2016 • Couples\nThis place it next to Trang Tien Plaza, serving for breakfast only until 10:30am But if they are busy it could be sold out early , very tiny place but busy all the time, usually like most other street food business they will have to pack the chairs up and put everything inside when they see local police arrive from distance so please be aware that you will have to stand up and hold your bowl of noodle and wait till the local police go pass before you can have your chair back to seat down. That's just normal in Hanoi :) if you like to eat where only local eat the this place is a must try, for me it worth the hassle but I can not come back to Hanoi and not eat Pho Beef here\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 24, 2017",
